---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The mission and work behind Eternal Grace Hub."
>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Eternal Grace Hub</span><h1>
        Media made to keep Scripture close.
      </h1><p class="lead">
        We create films, music, and practical resources that help families and
        churches see Scripture clearly, sing with confidence, and carry the
        grace of Christ into everyday life.
      </p><div class="prose">
        <h2>One home for the work</h2><p>
          BibleInVideo brings biblical narratives to the screen with care and
          reverence. Eternal Grace Music turns Scripture into songs that can
          live in a home, a prayer room, or a congregation.
        </p><h2>Built to serve</h2><p>
          Every release is prepared for both personal devotion and ministry use.
          Customer accounts keep purchased resources available, while the staff
          portal gives the team a disciplined publishing and support workflow.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
